        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "In this paper we presented a novel partition-based method for under-approximating the terminal time",
      "bbox": [
        56.693084716796875,
        610.6852416992188,
        555.3807373046875,
        621.5943603515625
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "probability through sample reduction.",
      "bbox": [
        56.693084716796875,
        624.2341918945312,
        242.69322204589844,
        635.143310546875
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "By using Hoeﬀding’s inequality, we provided a bound on the",
      "bbox": [
        252.1295928955078,
        624.2341918945312,
        555.413330078125,
        635.143310546875
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "required number of scenarios to achieve a desired probabilistic bound on the approximation error. Fur-",
      "bbox": [
        56.693084716796875,
        637.783203125,
        555.3916015625,
        648.6923217773438
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "thermore, we proposed a method which clusters the taken scenarios in few cells, each cell represented",
      "bbox": [
        56.693084716796875,
        651.3322143554688,
        555.2930908203125,
        662.2413330078125
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "by a seed, where the number of cells is selected by the user in a systematic manner using the trend of",
      "bbox": [
        56.693084716796875,
        664.8822021484375,
        555.3152465820312,
        675.7913208007812
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "a given curve or based on the desired running time. The proposed method scales easily with dimension",
      "bbox": [
        56.693084716796875,
        678.4312133789062,
        555.3478393554688,
        689.34033203125
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "since the clustering computational complexity increases linearly with the dimension of data. In addition,",
      "bbox": [
        56.693084716796875,
        691.980224609375,
        555.3695678710938,
        702.8893432617188
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "the simulation results conﬁrm that the proposed method signiﬁcantly decrease the running time, and",
      "bbox": [
        56.693084716796875,
        705.5292358398438,
        555.3696899414062,
        716.4383544921875
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
